  Slug: bookkeeper
  DisplayName: Bookkeeper
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You ran the numbers on a large farm, for a merchant's endeavors, or
    with a major guild in the city. You kept track of expenses, payroll, profits,
    and anything else that had to do with money, for better or worse. If better,
    you might be adventuring to learn how others ply this trade. If worse, you may
    be fleeing from impending consequences in the hope that no one finds you. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Society skill and the Accounting Lore
    skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Eye for Numbers] skill
    feat.
